  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "舒适的港湾",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/49096",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=49096",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"49096\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这张床造型简单利落，搭配其他家具毫无压力，床头板带有可水洗的织物衬套，令整个卧室更显宁静舒适。配上床垫，对身体起到很好的支撑作用，保证你享有惬意的睡眠环境。",
    "舒适的港湾"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2a929c0222c8c180/original/PH184477.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/49096",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2a929c0222c8c180/original/PH184477.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "KLEPPSTAD 克勒普斯塔 床上铺着ÄNGSLILJA 安斯莉娅 床用织品，上方的墙上有一盏灯，地板上有一双拖鞋。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2a929c0222c8c180/original/PH184477.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
