   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "有序摆放，随用随取",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/19059",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=19059",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"19059\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "有了这个拉出式床头柜，你的晚间用品不会再散乱无序。两个宽敞的搁架可以将书和其他小物件收纳整齐，还可以摆放多余的靠垫、毛毯或浴袍等。",
    "有序摆放，随用随取"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/53a8b7653f2f708e/original/PH184474.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/19059",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/53a8b7653f2f708e/original/PH184474.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "床头一角，旁边有两张FREDVANG 弗瑞芳 床下储物桌。其中一张储物桌表面放着杯子和时钟，下面放着书。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/53a8b7653f2f708e/original/PH184474.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
