     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2f27f48e299916b8/original/PH184476.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "床边墙壁上有一面NISSEDAL 尼瑟达 镜子，镜子里映照着一个开放式壁式储物装置，旁边是带浅灰色窗帘的窗户和百叶帘。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2f27f48e299916b8/original/PH184476.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
